        <mxCell id="note_ip" value="&lt;b&gt;Connection constraint worth knowing.&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;FMF_DATABASE_URL&lt;/i&gt; must be the Supavisor &lt;b&gt;session mode&lt;/b&gt; pooler URL (&lt;i&gt;aws-N-ap-southeast-1.pooler.supabase.com&lt;/i&gt;, port 5432), not Supabase's direct connection string. Render's network is IPv4-only and the direct string resolves to IPv6, so the direct URL fails to connect." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingRight=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;strokeWidth=1.2;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D9A91A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="960" y="530" width="330" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_sec" value="&lt;b&gt;Secrets.&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;GEMINI_API_KEY&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;FMF_DATABASE_URL&lt;/i&gt; are set in the Render dashboard with &lt;i&gt;sync: false&lt;/i&gt; &amp;#8212; never committed. &lt;i&gt;backend/.env.example&lt;/i&gt; documents their shape without values." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingRight=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;strokeWidth=1.2;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D9A91A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
